msgid ""
"Optional. When set together with Low color, Mid color, and High color "
"below, colors diverge from Mid color at this value toward Low color below"
" it and High color above it, instead of a single color fading in and out."
" For % of column with Column sum, the resolved center must still fall "
"inside the color range; otherwise the rule uses its single color."
msgstr ""
"Optional. Zusammen mit den unten stehenden Feldern „Farbe für niedrige "
"Werte“, „Farbe für mittlere Werte“ und „Farbe für hohe Werte“ laufen die "
